---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="EV Charging, BESS and Utility Contractor in California" description="California C-10 and Class A contractor for EV charging, battery storage and utility infrastructure. Self-performed civil and electrical from first dig to energization." path="/" home>
<header class="dhero" id="top"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="dhero-top">
    <div>
      <p class="label">For charging networks, program managers, fleets and developers</p>
      <h1>Your sites, built and energized. <em>One contractor.</em></h1>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lead">California C-10 and Class A contractor for EV charging, battery storage and utility infrastructure. Our own crews self-perform the civil and the electrical, from first dig to utility energization, so your schedule has one owner.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Send us a plan set</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/safety/#prequal">Prequalification documents</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="creds" aria-label="Licenses and registrations">
    <li>Underground specialists</li><li>C-10 Electrical</li><li>Class A General Engineering</li><li>CSLB #996042</li><li>DIR-registered</li><li>EVITP-certified</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="reel" aria-label="Drone footage of completed sites">
    <figure><video class="auto" src="/v-santamonica.mp4" poster="/v-santamonica.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Drone flyover, Santa Monica"></video><figcaption><b>Santa Monica</b><span>Electrify America · 2025</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure><video class="auto" src="/v-longbeach.mp4" poster="/v-longbeach.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Drone flyover, Long Beach"></video><figcaption><b>Long Beach</b><span>Tesla Supercharger · 2026</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure><video class="auto" src="/v-midway.mp4" poster="/v-midway.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Drone flyover, Midway, San Diego"></video><figcaption><b>Midway, San Diego</b><span>EVgo · 2026</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure><video class="auto" src="/v-university.mp4" poster="/v-university.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Drone flyover, University, San Diego"></video><figcaption><b>University, San Diego</b><span>EVgo · 2025</span></figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</div></header>
<div class="band" aria-label="Key figures"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="stat"><b>100+</b><span>EV charging sites delivered statewide</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>C-10 + A</b><span>One license, trenching through termination</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>30–50%</b><span>Shorter open-trench exposure with prefab</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><b>±1/8″</b><span>Prefab dimensional tolerance</span></div>
</div></div>
<div class="wrap"><div class="trusted">
  <p class="label">Trusted by</p><b>Tesla</b><b>Electrify America</b><b>EVgo</b><b>Black &amp; Veatch</b>
  <small>Tier 1 subcontractor to Black &amp; Veatch, 100+ sites since 2016 · Approved vendor with Amazon, CBRE, Uber, Rivian, Tesla and Burns &amp; McDonnell</small>
</div></div>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="label">What we do</p><h2>Civil and electrical, one contractor.</h2><p class="lead">Explore each part of the scope, or see who we build for and the work we have delivered.</p></div><div class="svc"><a href="/conduit/"><img src="/c-lead.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Conduit</h3><p>Field-bent EMT and rigid banks, laid out before they are bent.</p><span class="go">View &rarr;</span></div></a><a href="/underground/"><img src="/u-ug2.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Underground</h3><p>Duct banks, vaults and pads built on our own equipment.</p><span class="go">View &rarr;</span></div></a><a href="/utility/"><img src="/u-sce.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Utility</h3><p>ROW work, boring and transformer pads through energization.</p><span class="go">View &rarr;</span></div></a><a href="/prefab/"><img src="/lift.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Prefab</h3><p>Built in the shop, installed in hours, set in one pick.</p><span class="go">View &rarr;</span></div></a><a href="/battery-storage/"><img src="/b-powerpack.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Battery storage</h3><p>40+ BESS sites, from excavation to metering.</p><span class="go">View &rarr;</span></div></a><a href="/work/"><img src="/diner.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><h3>Recent work</h3><p>160+ closed-out projects for the networks that set the standard.</p><span class="go">View &rarr;</span></div></a></div></div></section>
<section id="process" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">How we deliver</p>
    <h2>One crew from bid to closeout.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="process">
    <div class="phase"><i>01 · BID</i><h3>Precon and pricing</h3><p>Plan review, constructability questions and a lump-sum price with clear inclusions and exclusions.</p></div>
    <div class="phase"><i>02 · PERMIT</i><h3>Utility and permits</h3><p>Utility coordination, design questions to the engineer and inspection scheduling handled by our team.</p></div>
    <div class="phase"><i>03 · CIVIL</i><h3>Underground</h3><p>Trenching, boring, duct banks, vaults and pads with our own equipment. Prefab racks where they save days.</p></div>
    <div class="phase"><i>04 · ELECTRICAL</i><h3>Set and energize</h3><p>Gear sets, wire pulls, terminations, testing and utility energization.</p></div>
    <div class="phase"><i>05 · CLOSEOUT</i><h3>Turnover</h3><p>As-builts, test reports, photos and prevailing wage records delivered complete.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
